Checkpoint Store

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs

Checkpoint Store is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for governing checkpoint-specific physical storage, chunking, deduplication, replication, tiering, verification, retention, garbage collection, and restore.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Checkpoint Store does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Checkpoint Store accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.

This product contains a third-party component:

- Single-header SHA-256 implementation derived from the public-domain
  algorithm by Brad Conte (http://www.mherman.org/blog/2013/04/14/
  sha256-simple-implementation/), released to the public domain.
  Any local modifications are covered by the Apache License, Version 2.0.
